{"id":36,"titleZh":"什么是调式？","titleEn":"What Is a Mode?","date":"1966-11-23","dateZh":"1966 年 11 月 23 日","concepts":"教会调式（Church Modes）、白键音阶、古今音乐同源","thesis":"大小调统治西方不过两百年，中世纪的古老调式从未消失，至今仍用在德彪西和披头士的歌里。","plain":"14 岁的女儿在吉他上总弹不出摇滚热歌的和弦，促使伯恩斯坦开讲这一课。其实只按钢琴白键，从不同音起步就能弹出七种“教会调式”；哪怕只改动一个音高，就能让普通旋律产生摇滚、民间舞曲或印象派的独特色彩。","scenes":["伯恩斯坦只用白键逐一弹奏各调式，先用普通小调再切回 Dorian 调式弹唱当时流行的《Along Comes Mary》，对比只差半音带来的听感变化。","他让全场孩子盯紧“怪音”拍手捉错——听出 F Lydian 的升四度和 G Mixolydian 的降七度，接着在钢琴与乐队上并排演示奇想乐队《You Really Got Me》、披头士《Norwegian Wood》与德彪西《夜曲·节日》。"],"category":"基础乐理","bilibili":{"bvid":"BV1BA41147pm","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1BA41147pm","title":"掘火中译：伯恩斯坦《年轻人的音乐会》| 什么是调式","duration":"53:37","uploader":"掘火档案（掘火中译）"},"scriptUrl":"https://leonardbernstein.com/lectures/television-scripts/young-peoples-concerts/what-is-a-mode","repertoire":[{"composer":"Debussy","piece":"Fêtes from Nocturnes","titleZh":"夜曲：节日","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/Music/16/24/06/mzm.swcudpab.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/f%C3%AAtes-from-nocturnes/336104809?i=336104836&uo=4","recordingArtist":"Charles Munch & Boston Symphony Orchestra","recordingTrack":"Fêtes (from Nocturnes)","youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Debussy%20F%C3%AAtes%20from%20Nocturnes+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Debussy%20F%C3%AAtes%20from%20Nocturnes"},{"composer":"The Association","piece":"Along Comes Mary","titleZh":"玛丽来了","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/c0/21/60/c021601b-fafe-f39e-d098-93a50811edc6/mzaf_855475176141385529.plus.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/along-comes-mary/342280030?i=342280057&uo=4","recordingArtist":"The Association","recordingTrack":"Along Comes Mary","youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=The%20Association%20Along%20Comes%20Mary+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/